# Generated evaluation data and local audio clips
*.json
*.jsonl
*.wav
*.opus
*.ogg
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.aac
*.flac
*.caf
*.aif
*.aiff
*.mp4

# Include metrics.json files
!metrics.json
